  "description": "DESCRIPTION\nCelebrate the most wonderful time of the year with this adorable Layered Merry Christmas Santa Door Sign SVG. Featuring a cheerful Santa Claus, festive red and white striped background, elegant “Merry Christmas” lettering, snowflakes, holly leaves, and evergreen accents, this design makes the perfect holiday decoration for your front door or entryway.\nDesigned with clean, multi-layered pieces, this laser-ready file creates a beautiful 3D wood sign that is easy to assemble and ideal for Christmas crafting, holiday gifts, and small business makers.\n✨ Design Features:\nIncludes 1 layered Merry Christmas round door sign\nCute smiling Santa Claus centerpiece\nElegant “Merry Christmas” layered script\nClassic red and white candy stripe background\nDecorative snowflakes, holly berries, and pine branches\nMulti-layer construction for a stunning 3D effect\nPrecision laser-cut friendly design with smooth cutting paths\nBeginner-friendly layered assembly\nPerfect for painting, staining, or natural wood finishes\nGreat for front doors, porches, holiday décor, Christmas gifts, and craft fairs\n📂 File Formats Included:\nSVG\nAI\nDXF\nEPS\nPDF\nDWG\nCompatible With:\nGlowforge\nxTool\nLightBurn\nOMTech\nThunder Laser\nAeon Laser\nCricut (SVG)\nSilhouette Designer Edition\nMost laser cutters and CNC machines supporting SVG/DXF files.\nCreate a warm holiday welcome with this timeless Santa Christmas sign that will become a favorite seasonal decoration for years to come.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>DESCRIPTION</p>\n<p>Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with this adorable Layered Merry Christmas Santa Door Sign SVG. Featuring a cheerful Santa Claus, festive red and white striped background, elegant “Merry Christmas” lettering, snowflakes, holly leaves, and evergreen accents, this design makes the perfect holiday decoration for your front door or entryway.</p>\n<p>Designed with clean, multi-layered pieces, this laser-ready file creates a beautiful 3D wood sign that is easy to assemble and ideal for Christmas crafting, holiday gifts, and small business makers.</p>\n<p>✨ Design Features:<br>\nIncludes 1 layered Merry Christmas round door sign<br>\nCute smiling Santa Claus centerpiece<br>\nElegant “Merry Christmas” layered script<br>\nClassic red and white candy stripe background<br>\nDecorative snowflakes, holly berries, and pine branches<br>\nMulti-layer construction for a stunning 3D effect<br>\nPrecision laser-cut friendly design with smooth cutting paths<br>\nBeginner-friendly layered assembly<br>\nPerfect for painting, staining, or natural wood finishes<br>\nGreat for front doors, porches, holiday décor, Christmas gifts, and craft fairs<br>\n📂 File Formats Included:<br>\nSVG<br>\nAI<br>\nDXF<br>\nEPS<br>\nPDF<br>\nDWG<br>\nCompatible With:<br>\nGlowforge<br>\nxTool<br>\nLightBurn<br>\nOMTech<br>\nThunder Laser<br>\nAeon Laser<br>\nCricut (SVG)<br>\nSilhouette Designer Edition<br>\nMost laser cutters and CNC machines supporting SVG/DXF files.</p>\n<p>Create a warm holiday welcome with this timeless Santa Christmas sign that will become a favorite seasonal decoration for years to come.</p>",
